    "headline": "High Wind Warning issued October 21 at 2:50PM AKDT until October 24 at 4:00PM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
    "description": "* WHAT...Southeast winds 30 to 40 mph with gusts up to 65 mph\nexpected.\n\n* WHERE...Yukon Delta Coast.\n\n* WHEN...From 4 AM Friday to 4 PM AKDT Saturday.\n\n* IMPACTS...High winds may move loose debris, damage property and\ncause power outages. Travel could be difficult.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...A rain/snow mix is expected Thursday night\ninto early Friday morning. Combined with the strong winds, periods\nof reduced visibility due to blowing snow are possible Friday\nmorning and afternoon. Snow will change to completely to rain along\nthe coast as early as 12 PM.",
